& [RequiredMeaning] is explicit
  + NonAtomicRepeatedInventoryEqual is issuable only after two distinct actual complete acquisitions exist
  + the first acquisition completes before the second begins under an exact evidenced order
  + both acquisitions bind the same root identity, scanner profile, encoding profile, limits, policy, and comparison scope
  + each acquisition retains independent complete inventory and canonical ordered-digest lineage
  + current pure reconciliation must rederive both carriers and yield Equal
  + form construction or supplied equality alone remains insufficient
  + intermediate, subsequent, external-writer, quiescence, atomicity, and snapshot claims remain denied

& [RequirementDelta] is proposed P3TSFR-001 through P3TSFR-010
  + preserve exact prior source, canonical formation, signature, completed forms revision, and proof as distinct inputs
  + replace only stale evidence and receipt-field meaning through explicit supersession
  + retain scanner profile and every unaffected scanner formation invariant
  + specify complete dual-acquisition lineage, exact order, common scope, and current reconciliation dependency
  + separate structural receipt validity, scanner issuance, later consumption, and world-state claims
  + preserve strict legacy non-governance without rewriting historical evidence
  + grant zero implementation, execution, physical, issuer, consumer, or effect authority
  + require full SJS, artifact binding, replacement formation signature, provenance, rollback, and nonclaims

& [StopBoundary] is mandatory
  - no production Rust, Cargo, dependency, unsafe, windows-sys, Win32 call, filesystem access, handle, pointer, clock, random, process, network, database, Git runtime, model, tool, fixture, scan, acquisition, receipt issuance, consumption, admission, mutation, seal, test execution, cleanup, promotion, neural routing, distributed inference, or FPGA execution
  - no profile change outside the exact formation revision
  - no supplied Equal conversion into actual acquisition evidence
  - no rewriting of the 2026-07-30 source or canonical formation
  - stop on source ambiguity, scope expansion, hidden physical authority, or inability to preserve exact supersession lineage

& [Decision] is source preservation before SJS
  + [next] preserve one verbose raw derived revision source plus exact source manifest
  + [then] audit all governing inputs and run complete SJS before issuing any replacement formation signature
  + [implementation_authority] is absent
